  * Boot arguments:
  *   nabugpu2=1        run at all
  *   nabugpu2_pause=MS wait after each announcement (default 2200)
+ *   nabugpu2_pause4=MS override only the wait after CX power-on (0..60000)
  *   nabugpu2_watch=S  report liveness for S seconds afterwards
  *   nabugpu2_noread=1 after the wait, do not touch the GMU clock registers
  *                    (separates a stalled wait/wakeup from the first access)
@@ -54,6 +55,7 @@
